---
export const prerender = false;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Delivery & Service — KINBO | 01 SIGNAL"
  description="Terms of Service, milestone payment guarantees, and 100% Day-1 source code ownership terms for KINBO TECHNOLOGIES."
  schemaType="AboutPage"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 pt-32 pb-24">
    {/* Breadcrumbs */}
    <div class="font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FF5A52] mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">HOME</a>
      <span class="text-[rgba(244,243,239,0.3)]">/</span>
      <span class="text-white">TERMS OF DELIVERY</span>
    </div>

    {/* Header */}
    <div class="border-b border-[rgba(244,243,239,0.14)] pb-8 mb-10">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF5A52] uppercase mb-1">
        ENGINEERING GOVERNANCE
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FFFFFF]">
        Terms of Delivery
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-[rgba(244,243,239,0.6)] mt-2">
        VERSION 2026.1 // 30-40-30 MILESTONE PROTOCOL // 100% DAY-1 REPO OWNERSHIP
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-[rgba(244,243,239,0.85)] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-6 bg-[#111111] border border-[rgba(244,243,239,0.14)] rounded-[6px]">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF5A52] mb-1">01 / CODE OWNERSHIP</div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">100% Day-1 Source Code Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          All source code, schemas, documentation, and build assets authored for custom client engagements are the exclusive property of the client. Repositories are transferred with standard open or commercial licenses upon milestone sign-off. KINBO retains no proprietary lock-in mechanisms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-[#111111] border border-[rgba(244,243,239,0.14)] rounded-[6px]">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF5A52] mb-1">02 / PAYMENT MILESTONE GATES</div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">30 / 40 / 30 Milestone Structure</h2>
        <p>
          Fixed-price contracts are governed deterministically:
          <br /><strong class="text-white">30% Spec:</strong> Due upon sign-off of architecture contracts and API schema specs.
          <br /><strong class="text-white">40% Build:</strong> Invoiced only after staging verification on live preview environments.
          <br /><strong class="text-white">30% Handover:</strong> Due upon final production acceptance, full Git transfer, and deployment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-[#111111] border border-[rgba(244,243,239,0.14)] rounded-[6px]">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF5A52] mb-1">03 / LIFELONG SUPPORT* SPECIFICATION</div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Defect Resolution Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          Lifelong support encompasses complimentary bug fixes and critical security defect remediations on all code delivered within the initially agreed scope. New feature sprints, architectural additions, or third-party infrastructure refactors outside the original specification are billed separately under optional monthly retainers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-[#111111] border border-[rgba(244,243,239,0.14)] rounded-[6px]">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#FF5A52] mb-1">04 / INFRASTRUCTURE BILLING</div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Direct Cloud Credentials</h2>
        <p>
          Hosting costs, server provisioning (AWS, DigitalOcean, VPS), Cloudflare accounts, and external third-party API keys (OpenAI, Stripe, Razorpay) are provisioned directly in the client's corporate name and payment card. KINBO never acts as an opaque markup reseller for cloud compute.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
